[00:00.00][by:吃蛋炒饭送老婆]
[00:01.00] 制作人 : Andrew Watt/Ed Sheeran/ILYA
[00:10.61]You should see the way the stars
[00:10.61] 你该看看 星光之下
[00:13.85]Illuminate your stunning silhouette
[00:13.85] 你的剪影 究竟多美
[00:17.67]You're glowing in the dark
[00:17.67] 你在黑暗中 熠熠生辉
[00:20.69]I had to count to ten and take a breath
[00:20.69] 我势必数到十 深吸一口气
[00:24.41]You think that you don't have
[00:24.41] 在你看来 你未尝拥有
[00:28.07]Beauty in abundance but you do
[00:28.07] 丰盈的美 但恰恰相反
[00:33.02]That's the truth
[00:33.02] 事实却正是如此
[00:38.06]You're frozen in motion
[00:38.06] 你停格在了那一瞬间
[00:41.47]A perfect picture in a frame
[00:41.47] 封存于相框里 无暇的照片中
[00:44.78]Some visions don't ever fade
[00:44.78] 有些影象 不曾斑驳
[00:49.64]I don't need a camera to capture this moment
[00:49.64] 我无需相机 捕捉这一刻
[00:55.98]I'll remember how you look tonight
[00:55.98] 我终生难忘
[01:00.27]For all my life
[01:00.27] 今晚你的模样
[01:03.14]When everything is black and white, your colour's exploding
[01:03.14] 就算一切 只剩黑白 你的色彩 绚丽烂漫
[01:09.95]There's something in the way you shine
[01:09.95] 你的光芒 与众不同
[01:15.23]I don't need a camera when you're in my eyes
[01:15.23] 我满眼是你 又何需相机
[01:22.59]You should see the way this night
[01:22.59] 你该看看 这个夜晚
[01:26.01]Is unfolding beautifully for us
[01:26.01] 在你我面前 缤纷呈现
[01:29.38]It's getting late, but I don't mind
[01:29.38] 天色已晚 我也不介意
[01:32.68]We'll take this in until the sun comes up
[01:32.68] 我们沉浸其中 直至晨光熹微
[01:36.16]And I think that what we have
[01:36.16] 我想我们所拥有的
[01:39.99]Is like every dream I had came true
[01:39.99] 都似梦般 渐渐成真
[01:44.85]Lying here with you
[01:44.85] 就这样 躺在你身旁
[01:50.05]A photo could not show
[01:50.05] 一张相片 拍不出的
[01:53.48]The way my heart is beating, babe
